<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; max-width: 640px;">
    <p>Dear {{data.teName}},</p>

    <p>
        The Bank Guarantee has been created and couriered. The soft copy of the BG is attached with this mail.
    </p>

    <p>
        {{#if data.courierNo}}
        <strong>Courier Docket no.:</strong> {{data.courierNo}}<br>
        {{/if}}
        {{#if data.courierProvider}}
        <strong>Courier Provider:</strong> {{data.courierProvider}}<br>
        {{/if}}
        <strong>Courier Docket Slip:</strong> will be shared shortly
    </p>

    {{#if data.reasons}}
    <p><strong>Remarks:</strong> {{data.reasons}}</p>
    {{/if}}

    <p>
        The SFMS confirmation of the BG will be sent in the next mail.
    </p>

    <p>
        Regards,<br>
        {{data.senderName}}<br>
        Tendering, Volks Energie Pvt. Ltd.
    </p>
</div>
